        <p>
          I'm Javier Negre, front-end developer based in Barcelona, experienced in responsive web
          and keen on UI/UX and data visualization
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="home-contact home-section">
        <h4 class="home-section-label">More about me</h4>
        <ul class="home-menu home-contact-links">
          <li><a href="/cv">CV</a></li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/javier-negre/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
              >Linkedin</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/javinegre" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
